  <p id="c-chenshu-028-shenwuhua-yin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">吳興王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenwuhua-yin:p001:m0003" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AB">胤</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenwuhua-yin:p001:m0005" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AB">承業</persName>，後主長子也。太建五年二月乙丑生于東宮，母<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenwuhua-yin:p001:m0028" ref="sxa_qn1_yt0">孫姬</persName>因產卒，<persName id="c-chenshu-028-shenwuhua-yin:p001:m0034" ref="9wm_vgh_vz1_AAA">沈皇后</persName>哀而養之，以為己子。</p>
</text>
